{"symbol":"RACONTEUR","yahoo":"RACONTEUR.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Raconteur Global Resources Limited","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Entertainment","website":"https://www.rgrl.in","about":"Raconteur Global Resources Limited, together with its subsidiaries, engages in trading business in India. It operates through Defence Equipment and Mining segments. The company exports and imports various types of major and minor minerals. It is also involved in dealing in waste and by products from the mining or processing of various types of stones; mining activities, quarrying of stone, and sand and clay and allied mineral extraction activities; and manufacture, trading, and supply of defence equipment. In addition, the company engages in real estate business; and provides information technology services. The company was formerly known as Ganesh Films India Limited and changed its name to Raconteur Global Resources Limited in December 2023. The company was incorporated in 2018 and is based in Goregaon, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:50:42+00:00","quote":{"price":9.8,"prevClose":9.8,"marketCap":13.01,"high52":19.2,"low52":8.78,"pe":null,"bookValue":17.25,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":-113.66,"shares":1.3278,"insiders":41.73,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2018-07-31","2018-08-01","2018-08-02","2018-08-03","2018-08-06","2018-08-07","2018-08-08","2018-08-09","2018-08-10","2018-08-13","2018-08-14","2018-08-16","2018-08-17","2018-08-20","2018-08-21","2018-08-23","2018-08-24","2018-08-27","2018-08-28","2018-08-29","2018-08-30","2018-08-31","2018-09-03","2018-09-04","2018-09-05","2018-09-06","2018-09-07","2018-09-10","2018-09-11","2018-09-12","2018-09-14","2018-09-17","2018-09-18","2018-09-19","2018-09-21","2018-09-24","2018-09-25","2018-09-26","2018-09-27","2018-09-28","2018-10-01","2018-10-03","2018-10-04","2018-10-05","2018-10-08","2018-10-09","2018-10-10","2018-10-11","2018-10-12","2018-10-15","2018-10-16","2018-10-17","2018-10-19","2018-10-22","2018-